owner.my.nom = мой {piece}
# The Analysis mode names a piece by its side, nobody being "ты" or "я" there: "белый конь",
# "чёрная ладья", by case and gender (an animate piece's accusative is its genitive, as above);
# pron_acc as for the other owners ("его" / "её").
